  "student_passage": "I like (1) ____ with my sister, although we do not often perform in front of other people. Last Friday, our teacher thanked (2) ____ for helping some younger students learn a short song. There were twelve (3) ____ in the group, and most of them had never stood on a stage before.\n\nThe small microphone was much (4) ____ than the old one we usually used. Everyone could hear the words clearly. Our teacher (5) ____ the equipment to the community room in her car. We waited beside the door and carried the lighter bags inside.\n\nI do not remember exactly (6) ____ the audience began arriving because I was busy arranging the chairs. My sister took several (7) ____ of the empty stage before the children came in. She wanted them to see what it had looked like before their first performance.\n\nOur group was the (8) ____ to perform that afternoon. The first three groups were older students from a nearby school. Afterwards, I (9) ____ the cupboard where we had put our bags. Nothing was left behind. We waited (10) ____ the teacher to bring her car round, then went home talking about the parts we had enjoyed most.",
