  "filled_passage": "I like (1) singing with my sister, although we do not often perform in front of other people. Last Friday, our teacher thanked (2) her for helping some younger students learn a short song. There were twelve (3) children in the group, and most of them had never stood on a stage before.\n\nThe small microphone was much (4) better than the old one we usually used. Everyone could hear the words clearly. Our teacher (5) drove the equipment to the community room in her car. We waited beside the door and carried the lighter bags inside.\n\nI do not remember exactly (6) when the audience began arriving because I was busy arranging the chairs. My sister took several (7) photos of the empty stage before the children came in. She wanted them to see what it had looked like before their first performance.\n\nOur group was the (8) fourth to perform that afternoon. The first three groups were older students from a nearby school. Afterwards, I (9) closed the cupboard where we had put our bags. Nothing was left behind. We waited (10) for the teacher to bring her car round, then went home talking about the parts we had enjoyed most.",
